repository-artifact: >-
abstract: >-
  This repository contains easily-relocatable single-column ACCESS-OM3-MOM6 configurations
  based on the single-column MOM6 configurations in the ocean_only/single_column directory
  of https://github.com/NOAA-GFDL/MOM6-examples. The configurations include WOMBAT ocean
  biogeochemistry.
